    "application": "BambuStudio-02.06.00.51",
    "profile_title": "Layers Carefully Tuned 4 Over Hang Fit & Material Waist.",
    "profile_notes": "Layers Carefully Tuned 4 Over Hang Fit & Material Waist. many many substantial value adding adjustments also that result in low filament material waist and quick print time with reasonably good strength… see the specifics below… 0.28mm layer, 1 walls, 0.6mm wall width, 0% infill, wall generator arachne, detect over hang walls off, detect narrow internal solid infill off, ensure vertical shell thickness disabled, acceleration speed [ short travel , initial layer travel, initial layer, outer wall, top surface ] all turned up to 10000mms. max volumetric speed for PLA, and PETG both set to 30mm3/s, cooling for over hangs set to 100%, minimum fan for layers less than 4 seconds 100% and for the other layer times 100% and auxiliary part cooling fan 70%. X - Y Contour compensation 0.1mm note that filament flow, and cooling settings will likely revert to default and acceleration speed will also likely revert to default if you use a different Bambu printer.",
